# How much to spend
![](../figures/profit_curve.png)

- Recommended: {{ recommendation.recommended_share | pct(0) }} of customers (chosen on validation)
- Test: {{ recommended.selected_count | num }} offers, {{ recommended.cost | usd }}, net {{ recommended.expected_net_value | usd }} (ROI {{ recommended.roi | pct(0) }})
- Stop adding budget when the next step earns less than {{ recommendation.hurdle_marginal_roi | pct(0) }}

Notes: Each extra step of budget reaches customers with lower expected value. Beyond about {{ curve.positive_ev_share | pct(0) }} of customers nobody has positive expected value, so spending more destroys value.

